{"4452220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Luna Hollow - Dream Eater Defense", "steam_appid": 4452220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite tower defense game with Vampire Survivors-style builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the dream world through 20 stages while unlocking 16 outfits for Holo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I'm afraid to sleep.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horo, a young girl who suffers from terrible nightmares,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is dragged into the mysterious dream world known as Luna Hollow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using her magical &quot;Dream Power&quot;,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452220/extras/b11c3e36a34bbba185d9e66396863836.avif?t=1773839428\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452220/extras_big/b11c3e36a34bbba185d9e66396863836.webp?t=1773839428 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she must defend the dream world from invading nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts, shadow monsters, and twisted dream creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >appear one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452220/extras/546dde2e36441ae2b8f0e478778d2e27.avif?t=1773839428\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luna Hollow: Dream Eater Defense is a cute yet eerie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tower defense game set in a whimsical nightmare world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect the dream realm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and help Horo escape from her nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452220/extras/fa35d193ff930c413550ff57562d4377.avif?t=1773839428\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cute yet spooky dream world  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Easy-to-play tower defense gameplay  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dress up Horo with adorable costumes  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore the dream world in different outfits  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Become stronger each run with a Vampire Survivors–style progression system  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unique nightmare monsters  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Magical and mysterious music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452220/extras/115f99c93edd8f05d09e5b7c9fcf589a.avif?t=1773839428\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Easy-to-play Tower Defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the dream world from waves of nightmare monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple and accessible tower defense system that anyone can enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452220/extras/424d3ae4216441d4b6f5bdba07d8be75.avif?t=1773839428\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Vampire Survivors–style Build System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose upgrades during gameplay and power up Horo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different abilities and dream powers to create your own unique build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run offers a different strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p clas